WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:06.680
¿Qué es esto?

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:09.920
Meet Gina’s mother.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:11.760
She doesn't have a home,

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.160
but she does have

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.080
a drinking problem,

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:16.720
bad credit score,

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.600
and two criminal records.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:23.520
Walt,

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:25.560
tell me you knew about this.

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:27.240
Go on.

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:28.520
Knock me out.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:29.600
Enough.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.600
I couldn't know about that

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:34.920
because it's an absolute lie.

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:38.840
I found your mother, Gina.

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:44.200
And where is she?

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:45.600
First, let's get rid of some

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.240
uninvited guests.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:50.440
Ma'am,

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:52.960
it's time for you to leave.

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:55.080
Escort her out

00:00:58.640 --> 00:00:59.400
and make sure

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:01.320
I never see you again.

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:14.680
Gina,

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:16.760
everything you need

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:17.760
is right here.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:18.640
Take it.
